<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Sikkimese Ghost Stories | Feels Like Om</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Guest publication by Cheryl Lim: Sikkimese Ghost Stories, drawn from her trip to Sikkim." />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/type-system.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Feels Like Om</a>
      <button class="mobile-nav-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <details class="nav-dropdown"><summary>ABOUT</summary><div class="submenu"><a href="/about/our-stories">Our stories</a><a href="/about/getting-to-sikkim">Getting to Sikkim</a><a href="/about/visa-and-permits">Visa and permits</a><a href="/about/media">Media</a></div></details>
        <details class="nav-dropdown"><summary>JOURNEYS</summary><div class="submenu"><a href="/journeys/the-flagship">The Flagship</a><a href="/journeys/how-to-embrace-suffering">To Be Free</a></div></details>
        <details class="nav-dropdown reflections-dropdown"><summary class="active">REFLECTIONS</summary><div class="submenu"><a href="/reflections">Guest Book</a><a href="/reflections/life-on-sikkim-time">Life on Sikkim time</a><a href="/reflections/sikkimese-ghost-stories">Sikkimese Ghost Stories</a></div></details>
        <a href="/contact">CONTACT</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="page-hero">
        <div class="wide">
          <p class="eyebrow">GUEST PUBLICATION</p>
          <h1>Sikkimese Ghost Stories</h1>
          <p class="byline">By <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cherylimqy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cheryl Lim</a></p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="publication-section">
        <div class="publication-intro">
          <p><em>This piece is drawn from Cheryl's trip to Sikkim, India’s northernmost state nestled in the Himalayas between Nepal, Tibet and Bhutan. In its remote mountain regions, local tribes have co-existed for centuries, living close to the land and passing down communal ways of life.</em></p>
        </div>

        <article class="publication-card">
          <a class="publication-image-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/cherylimqy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Read the full Sikkimese Ghost Stories publication">
            <img class="publication-image" src="/sikkimese-ghost-stories.jpg" alt="Screenshot of Sikkimese Ghost Stories by Cheryl Lim" />
          </a>
          <a class="publication-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/cherylimqy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the full publication here <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/mobile-nav.js" is:inline></script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:#f4efe5;color:#18301f;overflow-x:hidden;font-family:var(--font-body)}
  a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:.3rem}
  .wide{width:min(1180px,92%);margin:0 auto}
  .site-header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;padding:1.5rem 4%;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.15)}
  .brand{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
  .main-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.5rem;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .main-nav>a,.main-nav summary{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}
  .main-nav .active{border-bottom:1px solid currentColor}
  .nav-dropdown{position:relative}
  .nav-dropdown summary{list-style:none}
  .nav-dropdown summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .submenu{position:absolute;top:calc(100% + .65rem);right:0;width:max-content;min-width:12rem;padding:.7rem;background:#fffaf1;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(8,20,12,.13);z-index:10;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(-4px);transition:.16s}
  .submenu a{display:block;padding:.65rem .75rem;color:#18301f;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0}
  .submenu a:hover{background:rgba(24,48,31,.06)}
  @media(hover:hover){.nav-dropdown:hover .submenu{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translateY(0)}}
  .page-hero{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,8rem) 0 clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem);text-align:center}
  .eyebrow{margin:0 0 1.2rem;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .page-hero h1{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--type-display)!important;line-height:.98;font-weight:400}
  .byline{margin:1.35rem 0 0;font-size:var(--type-body)!important}
  .byline a{text-decoration:underline}
  .publication-section{padding:0 4% clamp(7rem,12vw,10rem)}
  .publication-intro{width:min(860px,100%);margin:0 auto clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem);text-align:center}
  .publication-intro p{margin:0;line-height:1.7;font-size:var(--type-lead)!important}
  .publication-card{width:min(1080px,100%);margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);background:#fffaf1;border:1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.14);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(24,48,31,.08)}
  .publication-image-link{display:block;text-decoration:none}
  .publication-image{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid rgba(24,48,31,.12);transition:opacity 180ms ease}
  .publication-image-link:hover .publication-image{opacity:.94}
  .publication-link{display:inline-flex;gap:.55rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1.5rem;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:var(--type-cta);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;padding-bottom:.12rem}
  @media(max-width:760px){
    .site-header{align-items:flex-start;padding:1.15rem 1.25rem}
    .main-nav{gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end}
    .submenu{right:auto;left:0}
    .nav-dropdown[open] .submenu{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translateY(0)}
    .wide{width:calc(100% - 2.5rem)}
    .page-hero{padding-top:4rem}
    .publication-section{padding-left:1.25rem;padding-right:1.25rem}
    .publication-intro{text-align:left;margin-bottom:2.5rem}
    .publication-card{padding:1.25rem}
  }
</style>
